WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.568 --> 00:00:16.368
Lip color is based on your personal color — warm or cool tone — but generally it's best matched to your overall wedding-parent look.

2
00:00:16.704 --> 00:00:24.888
Pink, coral, orange, or red tones are applied depending on whether your skin is cool or warm,

3
00:00:25.224 --> 00:00:31.416
and rather than using just one shade, we usually blend two or three colors to match your skin tone.

4
00:00:31.752 --> 00:00:41.112
Adding a touch of moisturizing gloss to the center of the lower lip also gives a healthy, radiant look.

5
00:00:41.448 --> 00:00:49.848
Overly nude or dark brown shades can make your complexion look dull and add ten years to your appearance,

6
00:00:50.184 --> 00:00:56.616
so it's better to choose a shade one tone brighter than usual for a more vibrant look.

7
00:00:56.952 --> 00:01:05.208
Going for a "natural" brown lip can actually age you and dim your radiance, so be careful.

8
00:01:05.544 --> 00:01:17.472
"I've never worn this color, it feels strange," some say — but experience shows it truly suits hanbok, so trusting the expert's advice is worthwhile.

9
00:01:17.808 --> 00:01:24.096
"Can I bring my usual lipstick?" is a common question too.

10
00:01:24.432 --> 00:01:29.568
Yes, feel free to bring the lipstick you normally wear.

11
00:01:29.904 --> 00:01:39.888
If you're attached to a familiar red or a signature color, using it can help you feel much more at ease.

12
00:01:40.224 --> 00:01:47.112
The artist will consider how your lipstick's tone works with your outfit's colors,

13
00:01:47.448 --> 00:01:55.344
sometimes using it as-is, other times blending in other shades for a more polished result.

14
00:01:55.680 --> 00:02:00.144
Since lip color plays a big role in your overall complexion,

15
00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:10.872
following the expert's advice for a shade brighter than usual can earn you plenty of compliments from guests.

16
00:02:11.208 --> 00:02:19.776
But if the color you bring doesn't suit your skin tone, we'll explain why and suggest an alternative.
